Numeric Functions
=================
1.abs():-Absolute value for a number

mysql> SELECT ABS(-100)AS ABSOLUTE_VALUE;
+----------------+
| ABSOLUTE_VALUE |
+----------------+
|            100 |
+----------------+
2.ceil():-Rounded up

mysql> SELECT CEIL(23.67)AS ROUNDED_UP;
+------------+
| ROUNDED_UP |
+------------+
|         24 |
+------------+

3.floor():-Rounded Down

mysql> SELECT FLOOR(45.89) AS ROUNDED_VALUE;
+---------------+
| ROUNDED_VALUE |
+---------------+
|            45 |
+---------------+

4.round():-Round to a specific number of digits

mysql> SELECT ROUND(45.7894,2) AS ROUNDED_VALUE;
+---------------+
| ROUNDED_VALUE |
+---------------+
|         45.79 |

5.mod():-Modulo  Value

mysql> SELECT MOD(19,6) AS REMAINDER;
+-----------+
| REMAINDER |
+-----------+
|         1 |
+-----------+


